<title>USA: Electromagnetic Sciences offers stock swap.</title>
<headline>Electromagnetic Sciences offers stock swap.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Electromagnetic Sciences Inc said Thursday it has proposed offering 0.75 shares of its common stock in exchange for each outstanding share of LXE Inc's common stock in an effort to acquire all of LXE.</p>
<p>Electromagnetic Sciences currently owns about 81 percent of LXE's outstanding shares.</p>
<p>The proposed offering would be open to all holders of the 1,030,000 shares held by other investors, it said.</p>
<p>Electromagnetic Sciences said it does not expect the registration process to be completed before November.</p>
</text>
